 5. 🔎 What rural voters want 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data : KFF/AP Rural Voters Survey. Chart: Herb Scribner Cost of living and health care top the list of issues rural voters want 2026 midterm candidates to address, Axios' Herb Scribner reports from a new AP/KFF poll . 

 Affordability concerns rank above immigration, the conflict with Iran and several major domestic policy debates. Reality check: Rural voters' unhappiness with rising costs doesn't necessarily translate into support for Democrats.

 According to the poll, 40% trust Republicans more to handle the cost of living. 25% trust Democrats and 27% trust neither party. Explore the data ... Read our story . 

 
 
