 7. 🚶 Data du jour: America&#x27;s top walkers 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data : StreetLight. Chart: Jim Sergent/Axios The average American walked 151 miles in 2024, according to research from StreetLight, a transportation data firm. 

 But some cities logged far more miles than others. Orlando topped the list — all those steps inside Disney World add up! Explore the data . 

 
 
